  "question": {
    "text": "Two identical springs are connected to mass \\(\\mathrm{m}\\) as shown \\((\\mathrm{k}=\\) spring constant). If the period of the configuration in (a) is \\(2 \\mathrm{~S}\\), the period of the configuration (b) is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
