  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned} & \\text {Hints: } \\frac{\\mathrm{T}_1}{\\mathrm{~T}_2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{k}_2}{\\mathrm{k}_1}} \\Rightarrow \\frac{2}{\\mathrm{~T}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2 \\mathrm{k}}{\\frac{\\mathrm{k}}{2}}}=2 \\\\ & \\therefore \\mathrm{T}=1 \\mathrm{~S}\\end{aligned}\\)\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/0l5EkFSmtartzOmFLKUuJIPB5LoZJyRurXlHA5pNWOA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
